1
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,590
sparks of light / across my heart

2
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,640
my quiet breath / shatters

3
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,900
in an instant / consumed by you

4
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,300
(whispered) wake up… wake up…

5
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,780
over lights bleeding deep

6
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,300
my feet move before I think

7
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:41,720
broken rhythm, fractured air

8
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,650
amid it all, only you are clear

9
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,340
fading as they overlap

10
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,520
neon shards cutting through me

11
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,490
it hurts a little, but that's okay

12
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:52,490
right now I'm on my way to you

13
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:54,870
you're the signal / I'm the crash

14
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:58,870
a glow spreading inside me now

15
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:01,030
if this is all, just this once

16
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:03,970
I won't hesitate

17
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:06,130
I'm on my way to you

18
00:01:06,130 --> 00:01:08,240
after cutting through the light

19
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,560
beyond every memory

20
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:12,560
one name I ran toward

21
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,640
I'm on my way to you

22
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,610
following your fleeting breath

23
00:01:16,610 --> 00:01:18,950
a night that never stops

24
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:21,110
a dream that ends with you

25
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:23,250
through the gaps in broken lights

26
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:25,250
you keep on shining

27
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:27,280
if I reach out

28
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,680
a glitchy love almost within reach

29
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,800
unfamiliar, yet vividly you

30
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,980
familiar, yet strangely me

31
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:36,190
what opened up between us

32
00:01:36,190 --> 00:01:38,080
wasn't light — it was distance

33
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:40,130
you're the pattern / I'm the error

34
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:42,540
collapsed beat, bleeding color

35
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:44,420
it's okay to break apart now

36
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:53,360
because this is real

37
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,430
I'm on my way to you

38
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:16,820
a night spreading like an error

39
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,140
even if I replay it all

40
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:21,120
the ending is always you

41
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,000
I'm on my way to you

42
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,100
a heart like a vector, pointing toward you

43
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:28,070
speaking without words

44
00:02:28,070 --> 00:02:29,430
"right now, I'm headed for you"

45
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,810
as if my breath would stop

46
00:02:38,810 --> 00:02:39,870
light wraps around me

47
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:41,980
my memories reboot

48
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:43,160
a single pulse

49
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,160
is this a dream

50
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:45,560
still, I keep going—

51
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:05,850
I'm on my way to you

52
00:03:05,850 --> 00:03:08,090
this is my last...

53
00:03:08,090 --> 00:03:09,570
even if I'm broken

54
00:03:09,570 --> 00:03:12,620
I want to reach you

55
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:14,420
I'm on my way to you

56
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:16,550
a heart burning hotter than speed

57
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:19,320
that was everything

58
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:21,370
it was you all along
